Read and follow `AI_WORKING_RULES.md`.

In short:

- prefer update/delete over adding new files
- define what must pass, proof artifact, and fallback before implementation
- prove strategic redirects before broad rewrites or deletions
- keep test backing proportional to implementation size
- treat hardcoded secrets as release blockers in public/shared repos
- work collaboratively and evidence-first
